-0349","start":349,"end":351,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000253","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m022-0351","start":351,"end":353,"surface":"使人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、短稱或官稱指代待核；不補造姓名或自動合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m022-0356","start":356,"end":358,"surface":"蹇叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000377","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p025","text":"晉獻公卒。立驪姬子奚齊，其臣里克殺奚齊。荀息立卓子，克又殺卓子及荀息。夷吾使人請秦，求入晉。於是繆公許之，使百里傒將兵送夷吾。夷吾謂曰：「誠得立，請割晉之河西八城與秦。」及至，已立，而使丕鄭謝秦，背約不與河西城，而殺裏克。丕鄭聞之，恐，因與繆公謀曰：「晉人不欲夷吾，實欲重耳。今背秦約而殺裏克，皆呂甥、郤芮之計也。願君以利急召呂、郤，呂、郤至，則更入重耳便。」繆公許之，使人與丕鄭歸，召呂、郤。呂、郤等疑丕鄭有閒，乃言夷吾殺丕鄭。丕鄭子丕豹奔秦，說繆公曰：「晉君無道，百姓不親，可伐也。」繆公曰：「百姓茍不便，何故能誅其大臣？能誅其大臣，此其調也。」不聽，而陰用豹。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m025-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"晉獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000374","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m025-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"驪姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000378","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m025-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"奚齊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m025-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"其臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、短稱或官稱指代待核；不補造姓名或自動合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m025-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"里克","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000381","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m025-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"奚齊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m025-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"荀息","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000382","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m025-0023",