l_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m027-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000253","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m027-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"公孫支","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000388","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m027-0029","start":29,"end":30,"surface":"支","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000388","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m027-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"百里傒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000376","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m027-0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"傒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000376","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m027-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"夷吾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000379","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m027-0071","start":71,"end":74,"surface":"百里傒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000376","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m027-0075","start":75,"end":78,"surface":"公孫支","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000388","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p032","text":"鄭人有賣鄭於秦曰：「我主其城門，鄭可襲也。」繆公問蹇叔、百里傒，對曰：「徑數國千里而襲人，希有得利者。且人賣鄭，庸知我國人不有以我情告鄭者乎？不可。」繆公曰：「子不知也，吾已決矣。」遂發兵，使百里傒子孟明視，蹇叔子西乞術及白乙丙將兵。行日，百里傒、蹇叔二人哭之。繆公聞，怒曰：「孤發兵而子沮哭吾軍，何也？」二老曰：「臣非敢沮君軍。軍行，臣子與往；臣老，遲還恐不相見，故哭耳。」二老退，謂其子曰：「汝軍即敗，必於殽阨矣。」三十三年春，秦兵遂東，更晉地，過周北門。周王孫滿曰：「秦師無禮，不敗何待！」兵至滑，鄭販賣賈人弦高，持十二牛將賣之周，見秦兵，恐死虜，因獻其牛，曰：「聞大國將誅鄭，鄭君謹修守御備，使臣以牛十二勞軍士。」秦三將軍相謂曰：「將襲鄭，鄭今已覺之，往無及已。」滅滑。滑，晉之邊邑也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m032-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"鄭人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m032-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"