補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m032-0193","start":193,"end":195,"surface":"其子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m032-0230","start":230,"end":234,"surface":"周王孫滿","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000258","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m032-0257","start":257,"end":259,"surface":"弦高","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000395","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m032-0292","start":292,"end":294,"surface":"鄭君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m032-0312","start":312,"end":315,"surface":"三將軍","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p033","text":"當是時，晉文公喪尚未葬。太子襄公怒曰：「秦侮我孤，因喪破我滑。」遂墨衰絰，發兵遮秦兵於殽，擊之，大破秦軍，無一人得脫者。虜秦三將以歸。文公夫人，秦女也，為秦三囚將請曰：「繆公之怨此三人入於骨髓，願令此三人歸，令我君得自快烹之。」晉君許之，歸秦三將。三將至，繆公素服郊迎，向三人哭曰：「孤以不用百里傒、蹇叔言以辱三子，三子何罪乎？子其悉心雪恥，毋怠。」遂復三人官秩如故，愈益厚之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m033-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"晉文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m033-0012","start":12,"end":16,"surface":"太子襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000396","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m033-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"三將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m033-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000252","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m033-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000253","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m033-0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"晉君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m033-0121","start":121,"end":123,"surface":"三將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m033-0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"三將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m033-0128","start":128,"end":130,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000253","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m033-0146","start":146,"end":149,"surface":"百里傒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000376","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m033-0150","start":150,"end":152,"surface":"蹇叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000377","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p037","text":"三十六年，繆公復益厚孟明等，使將兵伐晉，渡河焚船，大敗晉人，取王官及鄗，以報殽之役。晉人皆城守不敢出。於是繆公乃自茅津渡河，封殽中尸，為發喪，哭之三日。乃誓於軍曰：「嗟士卒！聽無譁，余誓告汝。古之人謀黃髪番番，則無所過。」以申思不用蹇叔、百里傒之謀，故作此誓，令後世以記余過。君子聞之，皆為垂涕，曰：「嗟乎！秦繆公之與人周也，卒得孟明之慶。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m037-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000253","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m037-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"孟明","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000392","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m037-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000253","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m037-0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"蹇叔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000377","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m037-0119","start":119,"end":122,"surface":"百里傒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000376","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m037-0154","start":154,"end":157,"surface":"秦繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000253","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m037-0165","start":165,"end":167,"surface":"孟明","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000392","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p034","text":"是歳也，晉復假道於虞以伐虢。虞之大夫宮之奇諫虞君曰：「晉不可假道也，是且滅虞。」虞君曰：「晉我同姓，不宜伐我。」宮之奇曰：「太伯、虞仲，太王之子也，太伯亡去，是以不嗣。虢仲、虢叔，王季之子也，爲文王卿士，其記勳在王室，藏於盟府。將虢是滅，何愛于虞？且虞之親能親於桓、莊之族乎？桓、莊之族何罪，盡滅之。虞之與虢，脣之與齒，脣亡則齒寒。」虞公不聽，遂許晉。宮之奇以其族去虞。其冬，晉滅虢，虢公丑奔周。還，襲滅虞，虜虞公及其大夫井伯百里奚以媵秦穆姬，而修虞祀。荀息牽曩所遺虞屈産之乘馬奉之獻公，獻公笑曰：「馬則吾馬，齒亦老矣！」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"宮之奇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001719","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"虞君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000375","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"虞君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000375","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"宮之奇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001719","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"太伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000172","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"虞仲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000173","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"太王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001720","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m034-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"太伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000172","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m0